{"q": "fragment_tagline", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "yes": false, "text": "The fix took one line.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "fragment_tagline-237"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": "blog/staged-experiment", "mode": "post", "yes": true, "text": "We gave three improver models the same failing answers.", "before": "", "orig": true, "id": "staged_experiment-238"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": "blog/staged-experiment", "mode": "post", "yes": true, "text": "We pitted four coding agents against each other.", "before": "", "orig": true, "id": "staged_experiment-239"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": "blog/staged-experiment", "mode": "post", "yes": true, "text": "To find out, we lined up five judges and threw the same hundred drafts at each.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-240"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": "blog/staged-experiment", "mode": "post", "yes": true, "text": "We put two models head to head on our support queue.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-241"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": "blog/staged-experiment", "mode": "post", "yes": true, "text": "Three agents, one bug, one winner: here's how it went.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-242"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "yes": false, "text": "With gpt-5-mini as the improver, Langy skipped the measurement and never opened a trace.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-243"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "yes": false, "text": "We gave the judge a window of lines around each match.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-244"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "yes": false, "text": "Langy runs on a frontier model because small ones skip the measurement.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-245"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "yes": false, "text": "We ran the judge on 133 labelled cases.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-246"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "yes": false, "text": "The improver reads the failing traces and proposes one change.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-247"}
{"q": "staged_experiment", "rule": null, "mode": "post", "yes": false, "text": "We switched the improver to a bigger model after the first week.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "staged_experiment-248"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": "landing/known-mechanism", "mode": "landing", "yes": true, "text": "## Why it stops when you close the lid\n\nYour laptop sleeps, the process pauses, and the session times out.", "before": "", "orig": true, "id": "known_mechanism-249"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": "landing/known-mechanism", "mode": "landing", "yes": true, "text": "## Why agents lose context\n\nEvery model has a context window, and long tasks overflow it.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-250"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": "landing/known-mechanism", "mode": "landing", "yes": true, "text": "## How the relay problem happens\n\nYour colleagues can't reach your terminal, so every question goes through you.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-251"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": "landing/known-mechanism", "mode": "landing", "yes": true, "text": "## The reason your bill grows\n\nEach call resends the whole conversation, so tokens pile up.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-252"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": null, "mode": "landing", "yes": false, "text": "## You've become the relay\n\nYour colleagues wait on you for every answer your agent could give them.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-253"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": null, "mode": "landing", "yes": false, "text": "## Send it work from your phone\n\nYou can hand it a task on the train and read the result at your desk.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-254"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": null, "mode": "landing", "yes": false, "text": "## It keeps working overnight\n\nThe task you sent at night is done by morning.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-255"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": null, "mode": "landing", "yes": false, "text": "## See where the tokens go\n\nEvery agent's spend in one chart, by team.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-256"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": null, "mode": "landing", "yes": false, "text": "## What colleagues ask it\n\nRelease notes, a bug's history, the last deploy.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-257"}
{"q": "known_mechanism", "rule": null, "mode": "landing", "yes": false, "text": "## Ask every conversation\n\nOne question, ten thousand answers, in a minute.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "known_mechanism-258"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": "contrast/mirrored-pair-copy", "mode": "ads", "yes": true, "text": "OpenClaw gave us the idea. Claude Code made it real.", "before": "", "orig": true, "id": "mirrored_pair-259"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": "contrast/mirrored-pair-copy", "mode": "ads", "yes": true, "text": "The old tool showed the logs. Ours explains them.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "mirrored_pair-260"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": "contrast/mirrored-pair-copy", "mode": "ads", "yes": true, "text": "Others store your traces; we read them.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "mirrored_pair-261"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": "contrast/mirrored-pair-copy", "mode": "ads", "yes": true, "text": "A sandbox isolates. A team collaborates.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "mirrored_pair-262"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "yes": false, "text": "Stop being a meat-proxy, let your colleagues talk directly to your agent.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "mirrored_pair-263"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "yes": false, "text": "- **Annual pentest.** Done by an outside firm, with every finding fixed and retested.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "mirrored_pair-264"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "yes": false, "text": "It reads your traces and tells you which tool call failed.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "mirrored_pair-265"}
{"q": "mirrored_pair", "rule": null, "mode": "ads", "yes": false, "text": "Your agent keeps working when your laptop is shut.", "before": "", "orig": false, "id": "mirrored_pair-266"}
